{"version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 9, "last_link_id": 7, "nodes": [{"id": 1, "type": "MarkdownNote", "pos": [0, 0], "size": [1600, 150], "flags": {}, "order": 0, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [], "properties": {}, "widgets_values": ["# Regression Model: Load & Predict\n\nLoad a saved regression model (architecture rebuilt **from the file alone** - no trainer, no skeleton), run **inference on fresh data** and export predictions vs. ground truth to CSV.\n\n**Prerequisite:** the file `output/regression_model.pt` must exist - run the *Tabular Regression: Production* template once (it saves there), or point `path` at any `.pt` written by `Model Save` / the trainer `save_path` widget."]}, {"id": 2, "type": "CdlRegressionModelLoad", "pos": [40, 300], "size": [400, 280], "flags": {}, "order": 1, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [{"name": "model", "type": "nn_model", "links": [1], "slot_index": 0}, {"name": "info", "type": "STRING", "links": null, "slot_index": 1}], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CdlRegressionModelLoad"}, "widgets_values": ["output/regression_model.pt", "relu"]}, {"id": 3, "type": "CdlFormulaDataGen", "pos": [580, 300], "size": [400, 460], "flags": {}, "order": 2, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"name": "model", "type": "nn_model", "link": null}], "outputs": [{"name": "X", "type": "TENSOR", "links": [2], "slot_index": 0}, {"name": "y", "type": "TENSOR", "links": [4], "slot_index": 1}, {"name": "dataset", "type": "DATASET", "links": null, "slot_index": 2}], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CdlFormulaDataGen"}, "widgets_values": ["2 + 3*x0 - 1.5*x1 + 0.5*x2", 1000, -3.0, 3.0, "uniform", "gaussian", 0.1, 777, "fixed"]}, {"id": 4, "type": "CdlModelForward", "pos": [1080, 300], "size": [380, 160], "flags": {}, "order": 3, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"name": "model", "type": "nn_model", "link": 1}, {"name": "tensor", "type": "TENSOR", "link": 2}], "outputs": [{"name": "output", "type": "TENSOR", "links": [3], "slot_index": 0}], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CdlModelForward"}}, {"id": 5, "type": "CdlTensorsToDataset", "pos": [1080, 560], "size": [380, 130], "flags": {}, "order": 4, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"name": "X", "type": "TENSOR", "link": 3}, {"name": "y", "type": "TENSOR", "link": 4}], "outputs": [{"name": "dataset", "type": "DATASET", "links": [5, 6], "slot_index": 0}], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CdlTensorsToDataset"}}, {"id": 6, "type": "CdlWriteCSV", "pos": [1560, 300], "size": [380, 160], "flags": {}, "order": 5, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"name": "dataset", "type": "DATASET", "link": 5}], "outputs": [{"name": "file", "type": "STRING", "links": null, "slot_index": 0}], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CdlWriteCSV"}, "widgets_values": ["regression_reuse_predictions.csv", true]}, {"id": 7, "type": "CdlDatasetPreview", "pos": [1560, 540], "size": [320, 140], "flags": {}, "order": 6, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"name": "dataset", "type": "DATASET", "link": 6}], "outputs": [{"name": "preview", "type": "STRING", "links": [7], "slot_index": 0}], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CdlDatasetPreview"}, "widgets_values": [5]}, {"id": 8, "type": "SaveText", "pos": [1560, 760], "size": [340, 160], "flags": {}, "order": 7, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"name": "text", "type": "STRING", "link": 7}], "outputs": [], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "SaveText"}, "widgets_values": ["regression_reuse_preview", "txt"]}, {"id": 9, "type": "MarkdownNote", "pos": [40, 900], "size": [480, 320], "flags": {}, "order": 8, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [], "properties": {}, "widgets_values": ["## Notes\n\n- `Regression Model Load` rebuilds input / hidden / output widths and the standardisation buffers from the weights; only the hidden-layer `activation` is a widget (a state_dict stores no activation parameters) - keep it consistent with training.\n- The loader reads from disk and has **no graph dependency on Model Save** - never put save and load in the same graph (the scheduler may run the load first). This template assumes 